            "review_title": "Review at Gia Vien",
            "review_text": "Toughasnail\nGold Coast, Australia5 contributions\n0\nBest eatery in Nha Trang\nSep 2016 • Family\nWe were in Nha Trang for seven days and didn't find this restaurant on our very last day. If we had found this place on the first day we would probably gone here for lunch and dinner every day.\n\nThe menu was extensive. The food were fresh, clean and authentic. Half the menu was Vietnamese and the other half was Chinese. Service was excellent, one of the best during our month long stay in VN. The whole place was spacious, roomy and air conditioned which most other restaurants in Nha Trang don't have.\n\nIt is a little bit outside of central Nha Trang but worth the trip ($4-5 taxi drive) you won't be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 7, 2016",
