            "review_title": "Review at Gia Vien",
            "review_text": "TranLuu\nMelbourne, Australia7 contributions\n0\nTruly Wonderful !!\nSep 2016 • Family\nThis is a new restaurant which only recently opened in the last few months. The place is spacious, clean, new and airconditioned. The menu is endless!! So many choices available and prices are very reasonable. We tried 6 dishes in total and they were all fabulous. The waitress could speak good English - and something that is unusual in Vietnam, they asked us to check the order first before it was processed and again before the bill/invoice was issued to us. Just to ensure no errors were made! The cuisine is authentic Chinese & Vietnamese. None of the fusion stuff that is on offer in Central Nha Trang. Its location is a bit further out to central Nha Trang - will need to take taxi ride. However, it's well worth it. The food & service is fantastic!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 7, 2016",
